    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoundUrbs is a minimalistic relaxing city builder game where you place variety of circular tiles connected to each other by roads to create unique city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Services</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose various environments to create you city:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Greenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Desert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/e9e0918d0bf44b49c4fd90e9daceb116.avif?t=1750359089\" width=736 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Score Mode - Place tiles next to each other strategically in order to get maximum score and level up to get more tiles to place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Sandbox Mode - Place unlimited tiles freely as per your wish to create city of your dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/3c2badd8212ed3ce98ce3e241b288bf8.avif?t=1750359089\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback. Thank you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoundUrbs is a minimalistic relaxing city builder game where you place variety of circular tiles connected to each other by roads to create unique city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Services</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose various environments to create you city:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Greenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Desert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/e9e0918d0bf44b49c4fd90e9daceb116.avif?t=1750359089\" width=736 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Score Mode - Place tiles next to each other strategically in order to get maximum score and level up to get more tiles to place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Sandbox Mode - Place unlimited tiles freely as per your wish to create city of your dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/3c2badd8212ed3ce98ce3e241b288bf8.avif?t=1750359089\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback. Thank you!</p>",
